	(text "LIS2DW12 accelerometer on I2C (SDA=PA2, SCL=PA3) from the 3.3 V rail. CS high = I2C mode; SDO/SA0 low = address 0x18; pin 7 RES to GND (DS11811 Table 1). FIRMWARE: set PINnCTRL.INLVL=TTL on IMU_INT's pin (the sensor's high is only ~3.1 V and the MCU runs at up to 4.2 V)."
